# <type>: <short summary, imperative mood, max ~72 chars>
#
# Types: feat, fix, docs, refactor, perf, test, build, ci, chore
#
# What changed and, if it is not obvious, how.
#
#
# Why: <the reason for this change, in one sentence>
#
# The Why line is required. It is what appears in docs/LEDGER.md, and it is
# the part that is impossible to reconstruct later from the diff.
#
# Example:
#   fix: stop the model server refusing to start without a GPU
#
#   load_model() raised when torch.cuda.is_available() was false. It now
#   loads on CPU in float32 instead.
#
#   Why: users without a GPU could not use the assistant at all.
